### Test Forum service bang REST Client (bam "Send Request" tren tung request)
### Can chay ca Identity (5101) va Forum (5107)
@identity = http://localhost:5101
@forum = http://localhost:5107

### 1. Dang nhap de lay token (dung tai khoan da dang ky)
# @name login
POST {{identity}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "champ@test.com",
  "password": "12345678"
}

### 2. Xem tat ca bai (co 3 bai mau)
# @name all
GET {{forum}}/api/forum/posts?filter=all
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 3. Chi bai cua chuyen gia
GET {{forum}}/api/forum/posts?filter=experts
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 4. Dang bai moi -> 201
# @name created
POST {{forum}}/api/forum/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "My first post from the REST client!"
}

### 5. Tim bai vua dang -> likeCount 1
POST {{forum}}/api/forum/posts/{{created.response.body.id}}/like
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 6. Bo tim -> likeCount 0
DELETE {{forum}}/api/forum/posts/{{created.response.body.id}}/like
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 7. Theo doi chuyen gia mau Linh Tran
POST {{forum}}/api/forum/follows/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 8. Tab Following -> chi con bai cua Linh Tran
GET {{forum}}/api/forum/posts?filter=following
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 9. Tu theo doi chinh minh -> 400
POST {{forum}}/api/forum/follows/{{login.response.body.user.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 10. Xoa bai cua minh -> 204
DELETE {{forum}}/api/forum/posts/{{created.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 11. Xoa bai cua nguoi khac -> 403
DELETE {{forum}}/api/forum/posts/{{all.response.body.$[0].id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 12. Khong gui token -> 401
GET {{forum}}/api/forum/posts
